#Решение_Trace_Linkage_Scope_Level_0<[
Базис:
  Work Graph has Trace Links v1 protocol and MVP validator/linkage/code-gap but not ioHasC generate or mandatory trace-links CI.
  Pre-decision analysis recorded in docs/analysis/2026-05-trace-linkage-necessity.md.
Вектор:
  Accept level 0: protocol + validator + optional code-gap; target_files-first authoring for code-facing work items.
  Reject full ioHasC step-to-code codegen and mandatory trace CI parity in rebuild scope without a superseding ADR.
  Defer level 1 trace label lint enforcement until recurring weak-target_files incidents justify it.
Цель:
  Stable decision memory for trace scope; avoid silent parity drift with ioHasC IDE.

Проверки:
  ADR-0001 accepted in docs/decisions/0001-trace-linkage-scope.md
  analysis linked from docs/decisions/README.md timeline
  audit-gap matrix references ADR-0001

